description:
The `reconcile-files` job runs every 15 min:
(a) `discovered` rows older than 5 min are enqueued (STR-305 path);
(b) `queued`/`classified` rows not updated for 30 min with attempts < 5 get their message re-sent and attempts incremented;
(c) rows with attempts ≥ 5 become `failed`;
(d) the last 2 hours of S3 listing are compared with the ledger, and any keys missing from the ledger are reported.
Model the status transitions as methods on a FileStatus enum that return Result.
